{"seq":3,"slug":"swift-language-advanced","title":"Swift 语言进阶","stage":"DONE","category":"mobile","chapterCount":6,"docCount":24,"url":"/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced","rating":{"composite":4.26,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.72,"verdict":"consider","uScore":4}},"introMarkdown":"# Swift 语言进阶 简介\n\nSwift 是一门兼具安全性、性能和表达力的现代编程语言。大多数开发者在掌握了基础语法、值类型与引用类型、可选值和协议基础之后，就能胜任日常的 iOS 和 macOS 应用开发。然而，当面对复杂的类型抽象、高并发场景、内存安全的精细控制以及编译期元编程等进阶需求时，仅凭基础知识往往力不从心。本手册聚焦 Swift 语言层面的高级特性，帮助你从\"能用 Swift\"进阶到\"精通 Swift\"。\n\n本手册适合已经具备 Swift 基础开发经验的工程师。如果你能够独立完成 SwiftUI 或 UIKit 应用的开发，熟悉协议、泛型和闭包的基本用法，但在类型系统的深度运用、并发模型的正确使用、内存管理的底层机制等方面仍有困惑，这里将为你提供系统而深入的进阶路径。\n\n第一章**类型系统**深入 Swift 泛型与类型抽象的核心能力。从泛型的高级用法到关联类型的约束设计，从不透明类型与存在类型的区别与选择到 Result Builders 的声明式 DSL 构建——类型系统是 Swift 最具深度的领域，掌握它意味着掌握了构建可复用、类型安全代码的根本能力。\n\n第二章**协议**系统阐述面向协议编程的设计哲学与实践。协议扩展如何提供默认实现、条件遵循如何实现精细化的类型约束、协议见证表如何在运行时完成方法派发——理解协议的编译期与运行时机制，是编写灵活且高性能 Swift 代码的关键。\n\n第三章**并发**全面覆盖 Swift 现代并发模型。async/await 如何取代回调地狱、结构化并发如何管理任务的生命周期、Actors 如何消除数据竞争、Sendable 协议如何在编译期保障跨隔离域的数据安全——Swift 并发模型是语言近年来最重要的演进，也是每位 Swift 开发者必须掌握的核心能力。\n\n第四章**内存模型**揭示 Swift 内存管理的底层机制。ARC 的引用计数操作如何在编译期被插入和优化、所有权与借用模型如何减少不必要的拷贝、写时复制策略如何在值语义与性能之间取得平衡、不安全指针如何在需要极致性能时突破安全边界——深入内存模型，是理解 Swift 性能特征的基础。\n\n第五章**宏与元编程**介绍 Swift 5.9 引入的宏系统。从宏的基本概念与分类到表达式宏的实现，从附加宏对类型的声明扩展到宏的测试策略——宏系统让 Swift 拥有了编译期代码生成的能力，为消除样板代码和构建领域特定抽象开辟了全新的可能。\n\n第六章**高级模式**汇集 Swift 中的高级编程技巧与模式。Key Paths 的函数式应用、自定义属性包装器的封装能力、动态成员查找的灵活性、ABI 稳定性对框架分发的意义——这些模式是将 Swift 的语言特性转化为优雅工程实践的桥梁。\n\n推荐的学习路径是先从类型系统和协议两章入手，建立扎实的类型抽象基础；然后深入并发与内存模型，掌握 Swift 运行时的核心机制；最后通过宏与元编程和高级模式拓展工程实践的边界。每一章都可以独立阅读，但按顺序学习能够获得最连贯的知识体系。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"type-system","title":"类型系统","docCount":4,"url":"/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/type-system","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"generics-deep-dive","title":"泛型深入","url":"/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/type-system/generics-deep-dive"},{"seq":2,"slug":"associated-types","title":"关联类型","url":"/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/type-system/associated-types"},{"seq":3,"slug":"opaque-and-existential-types","title":"不透明类型与存在类型","url":"/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/type-system/opaque-and-existential-types"},{"seq":4,"slug":"result-builders","title":"Result Builders 结果构建器","url":"/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/type-system/result-builders"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"protocols","title":"协议","docCount":4,"url":"/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/protocols","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"protocol-oriented-programming","title":"面向协议编程","url":"/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/protocols/protocol-oriented-programming"},{"seq":2,"slug":"protocol-extensions","title":"协议扩展","url":"/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/protocols/protocol-extensions"},{"seq":3,"slug":"conditional-conformance","title":"条件遵循","url":"/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/protocols/conditional-conformance"},{"seq":4,"slug":"protocol-witness-table","title":"协议见证表","url":"/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/protocols/protocol-witness-table"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"concurrency","title":"并发","docCount":4,"url":"/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/concurrency","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"async-await","title":"async/await 异步等待","url":"/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/concurrency/async-await"},{"seq":2,"slug":"structured-concurrency","title":"结构化并发","url":"/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/concurrency/structured-concurrency"},{"seq":3,"slug":"actors","title":"Actors 行为体","url":"/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/concurrency/actors"},{"seq":4,"slug":"sendable-and-isolation","title":"Sendable 与隔离","url":"/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/concurrency/sendable-and-isolation"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"memory-model","title":"内存模型","docCount":4,"url":"/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/memory-model","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"arc-internals","title":"ARC 内部机制","url":"/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/memory-model/arc-internals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ownership-and-borrowing","title":"所有权与借用","url":"/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/memory-model/ownership-and-borrowing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"copy-on-write","title":"写时复制","url":"/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/memory-model/copy-on-write"},{"seq":4,"slug":"unsafe-pointers","title":"不安全指针","url":"/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/memory-model/unsafe-pointers"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"macros-and-metaprogramming","title":"宏与元编程","docCount":4,"url":"/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/macros-and-metaprogramming","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"macro-fundamentals","title":"宏基础","url":"/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/macros-and-metaprogramming/macro-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"expression-macros","title":"表达式宏","url":"/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/macros-and-metaprogramming/expression-macros"},{"seq":3,"slug":"attached-macros","title":"附加宏","url":"/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/macros-and-metaprogramming/attached-macros"},{"seq":4,"slug":"macro-testing","title":"宏测试","url":"/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/macros-and-metaprogramming/macro-testing"}]},{"seq":6,"slug":"advanced-patterns","title":"高级模式","docCount":4,"url":"/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/advanced-patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"key-paths","title":"Key Paths 键路径","url":"/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/advanced-patterns/key-paths"},{"seq":2,"slug":"property-wrappers-custom","title":"自定义属性包装器","url":"/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/advanced-patterns/property-wrappers-custom"},{"seq":3,"slug":"dynamic-member-lookup","title":"动态成员查找","url":"/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/advanced-patterns/dynamic-member-lookup"},{"seq":4,"slug":"abi-stability","title":"ABI 稳定性","url":"/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/advanced-patterns/abi-stability"}]}]}